# Agent guide — Obsidian-Vault

Guidance for AI assistants working in this repository. Read this before
touching anything.

> Keep this file in sync with reality: if something here is wrong, fix the
> wrongness in the same change that touches it.

## 1. What this repo is

An **Obsidian vault + documentation hub** for the **kovanica-protocol**
project (a DAG-based distributed ledger following GHOSTDAG consensus).
Notes only — no application code lives here.

- Remote: `origin` → `https://github.com/KovanicaDAG/O
- bsidian-Vault.git` — **private**, branch `main`.
- Single-user repo (KovanicaDAG); pushes go straight to `main`.

